clueweb09-en0010-78-28916.180 Roswell Park Cancer Institute - Therapy Dogs - Comprehensive Cancer Center – every other Wednesday Rorie, Goldendoodle (Sandy Szopinski) – every other Wednesday Boogie, Boxer (Lisa Hatch) – every other Tuesday Stryder, Golden Retriever (Dr. Jill Kaplan) – every other Thursday Teva, Labrador Retriever (Jan & Rob Freeman) – every other Friday AM Buddy, Bassett Hound (Kathy Kowalczyk) – every other Friday AM Sadie, Dachshund (Kathy Krewer) – every other Friday PM Madison, Bearded Collie (Annie & Richard) – Friday PM The program uses only certified dogs (either Therapy Dogs International (TDI) or Delta Society's Pet Partners) with their volunteer owner. At this time, seven dogs and their owners visit the Institute and are often available during clinical hours 10:30 - 2:30 pm. Other pairs may join this rotation after a satisfactory review and certification through the Volunteer Office. For more information, please call 716-845-5708 or email to debra.miga@roswellpark.org To learn more, please read this press release. © Copyright , Roswell Park Cancer Institute | Elm & Carlton Streets | Buffalo, New York 14263 | 1-877-ASK-RPCI (1-877-275-7724) askrpci@roswellpark.org | Contact Us | Site Map | Public Notices | Employee Access © Copyright , Roswell Park Cancer Institute. [RSS | Roswell][QuantumCMS]
